<title>USA: Dental Services to buy dental practice.</title>
<headline>Dental Services to buy dental practice.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dental Services of America Inc said on Monday that it entered into a letter of intent to buy the assets of the dental practice of Dr. Lee Brushingham in Fort Lauderdale.</p>
<p>Dental Services said it expects that the purchase would add more than $500,000 in annual revenue to the company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
